            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.42

- Local areas is visibly disabled when the selected measure only supports states, with a clear availability note. Switching back to a supported measure restores your preferred area setting.
- States without data use a lighter grey with subtle diagonal slashes, making gaps easier to distinguish without heavy borders. The legend uses the same treatment.

These improvements are shared by Mac, iPhone and the web map.
]]></description>
